OL,3,GNEWSARescue trucks swept out to sea in
OL,4,Achild rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo beach trucks were swept out to sea
OL,7,Fafter becoming trapped in sand while a
OL,8,Fwarden rescued a child who was stuck in
OL,9,Fthe mud.
OL,11,FAfter one vehicle became trapped at
OL,12,FBrean beach, Somerset, a second truck
OL,13,Fwas deployed but also became lodged in
OL,14,Fthe quicksand on Wednesday.
OL,16,FSomerset Council, which is responsible
OL,17,Ffor the beach warden service, said the
OL,18,Fchild was taken to safety and no-one
OL,19,Fwas injured.
OL,21,FA World War Two truck was used to
OL,22,Frecover both vehicles on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
